  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.69,
      493.86,
      286.46,
      557.82
    ],
    "text": "The allotments of land in total extent of about 0.0031Hectare, depicted in Advance Tracing No. KA/DDN/14/37,30.05.2014 prepared by the Senior Surveyor-General of KalutharaDistrict, situated in the Village of Nebada in the DivisionalSecretary\u2019s Division of Dodangoda in Kaluthara District in WesternProvince and bounded as follows:",
